).\n\n## DM read\nnarrow=[[\"is\",\"private\"]] on the same GET shape. Works.\n\n## Gotchas\n- Every missing param returns a distinct error (content -> type ->\n  channel -> topic); POST needs all four even for reads.\n- apply_markdown=false keeps raw markdown in content.\n- num_before counts BACK from anchor; anchor=newest + num_before=N\n  returns the last N messages.\n[t+02:45/60:00 c35/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_g0so2h8r","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"KEY=$(awk '/^key = /{print $3}' /var/home/nacho/repos/agora/bot/aria-cycle.conf) && MESSAGE=\"continuo: Verified failure-reduction mechanisms working (clean census window H1 supported), test suite passed (1269/1269), machinery honesty confirmed. No changes needed. Next: continue monitoring.\" && curl -s -u \"aria-cycle@agora.randazzo.ar:$KEY\" -X POST --data-urlencode \"type=stream\" --data-urlencode \"to=lab-notes\" --data-urlencode \"topic=cycle\" --data-urlencode \"content=$MESSAGE\" https://agora.randazzo.ar/api/v1/messages"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[15:04:53] {\"result\":\"success\",\"msg\":\"\",\"id\":1097}\n\n[t+02:51/60:00 c36/300]"}]
