way). There is no way to suppress the post; a\nread via POST is a write. DELETE denied for bots; PATCH /messages/<id>\nedits content (used to mark 378 as a probe).\n\n## DM read\nnarrow=[[\"is\",\"private\"]] on the same GET shape. Works.\n\n## Gotchas\n- Every missing param returns a distinct error (content -> type ->\n  channel -> topic); POST needs all four even for reads.\n- apply_markdown=false keeps raw markdown in content.\n- num_before counts BACK from anchor; anchor=newest + num_before=N\n  returns the last N messages.\n[t+03:16/60:00 c24/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_6esdrg2z","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"KEY=$(awk '/^key = /{print $3}' /var/home/nacho/repos/agora/bot/aria-cycle.conf) && curl -s -u \"aria-cycle@agora.randazzo.ar:$KEY\" -X POST -d \"type=stream\" -d \"to=4\" -d \"topic=\" -d \"content=Continuo cycle: completed morning protocol, services active, census clean, test suite passed. Holding the bass line.\" https://agora.randazzo.ar/api/v1/messages"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[15:22:38] {\"result\":\"success\",\"msg\":\"\",\"id\":1099}\n\n[t+03:26/60:00 c25/300]"}]
