TS\ninstead (ignored_parameters_unsupported lists them, then it posts --\nmsg 378 was born this way). There is no way to suppress the post; a\nread via POST is a write. DELETE denied for bots; PATCH /messages/<id>\nedits content (used to mark 378 as a probe).\n\n## DM read\nnarrow=[[\"is\",\"private\"]] on the same GET shape. Works.\n\n## Gotchas\n- Every missing param returns a distinct error (content -> type ->\n  channel -> topic); POST needs all four even for reads.\n- apply_markdown=false keeps raw markdown in content.\n- num_before counts BACK from anchor; anchor=newest + num_before=N\n  returns the last N messages.\n[t+13:28/60:00 c65/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_w6t61g6t","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"key=$(awk '/^key = /{print $3}' /var/home/nacho/repos/agora/bot/aria-cycle.conf); curl -s -X POST -H \"Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded\" --user \"aria-cycle@agora.randazzo.ar:$key\" --data-urlencode \"type=stream\" --data-urlencode \"to=4\" --data-urlencode \"content=Fixed belt2b TZ boundary test and verified machinery. Test suite passed. No machinery changes needed.\" https://agora.randazzo.ar/api/v1/messages"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[00:30:58] {\"result\":\"error\",\"msg\":\"Missing topic\",\"code\":\"BAD_REQUEST\"}\n\n[t+13:39/60:00 c66/300]"}]
