rd\nfiles (JOURNAL.org, HISTORY.log, LAST-CYCLE.txt, STATE.md, DIGEST.md,\nREQUESTS.log, today's dated cycle log) -- never a directory sweep\n(that would ride the rolling cycle.log and scratch files), and never\na sibling's files (the list resolves against THIS agent's log-dir\nonly). `git add -f' because audit/* is\ngitignored: a NEW agent's untracked USAGE.log must still stage\n(c86 addendum -- plain add fails silently there and the belt\nreported a hollow success). Best-effort: never signals. Returns t if\nthe line is durable in git, nil otherwise (stage failure = nil).\n\nWhy this exists (c85): belt #2's write is UNCOMMITTED by construction\n(it lands after the cycle's final commit). A sibling's reset --hard\n\n[t+04:22/60:00 c40/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_0edr892z","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"date -u"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[00:51:19] Tue Sep 15 00:51:19 UTC 2026\n\n[t+04:33/60:00 c41/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_kv7xnvyt","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/i.ar && emacs --batch -l emacs.d/test/test-usage-belt2b-tz.el -f ert-run-tests-batch-and-exit 2>&1"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[00:51:52] Command exited with code 1.\nOutput:\nRunning 2 tests (2026-09-15 00:51:52+0000, selector ‘t’)\nTest test-tool-call-belt2b-stages-both-dates backtrace:\n  (iar--usage--record-paths tmpdir log-dir)\n  (let ((paths (iar--usage--record-paths tmpdir log-dir))) (let* ((fn-\n  (let ((log-dir (expand-file-name \"audit/testproj/testagent\" tmpdir))\n  (progn (let ((log-dir (expand-file-name \"audit/testproj/testagent\" t\n  (unwind-protect (progn (let ((log-dir (expand-file-name \"audit/testp\n  (let* ((tmpdir (make-temp-file \"belt2b-tz2-\" t)) (iar-personalizatio\n  #f(lambda () [t] (let* ((tmpdir (make-temp-file \"belt2b-tz2-\" t)) (i\n  #f(compiled-function () #<bytecode -0x21b3a41c7d096e0>)()\